rweight Fee:\n     - For weights over 53 lbs up to 70 lbs, the fee is $100.\n   - The higher of oversize and overweight fee should apply.\n   - Total Fee for Item 5: $200 (checking) + $200 (oversize) = $400\n\n5. **Item 6 (Luggage box):**\n   - Dimensions: 33 x 20 x 12 inches\n     - Total dimensions: 33 + 20 + 12 = 65 inches\n     - Over the standard size limit of 62 inches.\n   - Weight: 63 lbs\n     - Over the standard weight limit of 50 lbs but under 70 lbs.\n   - Checking Fee:\n     - For the fifth checked bag, the checking fee is $200.\n   - Oversize Fee:\n     - For dimensions over 62 inches up to 65 inches between the U.S. and Asia, the fee is $30.\n   - Overweight Fee:\n     - For weights over 53 lbs up to 70 lbs, the fee is $100.\n   - The higher of oversize and overweight fee should apply.\n   - Total Fee for Item 6: $200 (checking) + $100 (overweight) = $300\n\n6. **Item 7 (Backpack):**\n   - Dimensions: 53 x 34 x 27 inches\n     - Total dimensions: 53 + 34 + 27 = 114 inches\n     - Over the standard size limit of 62 inches.\n   - Weight: 53 lbs\n     - Over the standard weight limit of 50 lbs but under 70 lbs.\n   - Checking Fee:\n     - For the sixth checked bag, the checking fee is $200.\n   - Oversize Fee:\n     - For dimensions over 65 inches up to 115 inches between the U.S. and Asia, the fee is $200.\n   - Overweight Fee:\n     - For weights over 53 lbs up to 70 lbs, the fee is $100.\n   - The higher of oversize and overweight fee should apply.\n   - Total Fee for Item 7: $200 (checking) + $200 (oversize) = $400\n\n7. **Item 8 (Luggage box):**\n   - Dimensions: 46 x 30 x 25 inches\n     - Total dimensions: 46 + 30 + 25 = 101 inches\n     - Over the standard size limit of 62 inches.\n   - Weight: 65 lbs\n     - Over the standard weight limit of 50 lbs but under 70 lbs.\n   - Checking Fee:\n     - For the seventh checked bag, the checking fee is $200.\n   - Oversize Fee:\n     - For dimensions over 65 inches up to 115 inches between the U.S. and Asi